msgid "pio pkg pack"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:17
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:20
msgid "Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:27
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:29
msgid ""
"Create a tarball from a package (library, :ref:`platforms`, or tool). If no "
"arguments are supplied, then platformio packs the current package folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:32
msgid ""
"A source of a package must contain a manifest (should be located in a root "
"of a package) depending on a package type:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:0
msgid "Library"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:36
msgid "A :ref:`library_json` is a manifest file of a library package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:0
msgid "Platform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:39
msgid ""
"A ``platform.json`` is a manifest file of a development platform package. "
"See :ref:`platform_creating_manifest_file`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:0
msgid "Tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:42
msgid ""
"A ``package.json`` is a manifest file of a tool package. It is intended for "
"toolchains, flashers, debugging servers, simulators, and other tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:45
msgid ""
"See a `manifest validation scheme <https://github.com/platformio/platformio-"
"core/blob/develop/platformio/package/manifest/schema.py>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:48
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:55
msgid ""
"Specify a destination path (folder or a full path to file) where to store a "
"tarball. The default is to create a tarball in the current working directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:59
msgid "Files included in package"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:61
msgid "All files are included by default, with the following exceptions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:63
msgid ""
"Certain files that are relevant to package installation and distribution are "
"always included. For example, ``library.json``, ``README.md``, ``LICENSE``, "
"etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`manifest_library_json_export` field is not declared in the "
"manifest, the `next default filters <https://github.com/platformio/"
"platformio-core/blob/develop/platformio/package/pack.py#L35>`__ will be "
"applied"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_pack.rst:66
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`manifest_library_json_export` field is not declared in the "
"manifest and there is a ``.gitignore`` file, then ignored files in that and "
"all child directories will be excluded from the package."
msgstr ""

